==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A fairly easy battle. Bring some units like [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] or [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo Cat]] to keep Gory Groom in place. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] will immensely help in finishing the stage quickly.

